<head>
  <title>直積</title>
  <id>599504ca-aaf2-46ea-bdd5-ce3e6bde8e1a</id>
  <created>2022-06-28T17:37:46+09:00</created>
  <modified>2022-06-28T17:37:46+09:00</modified>
</head>

<body>
  <p>デカルト積とも呼ばれる。英語ではCartesian product。</p>
  <blockmath><![CDATA[A \times B = \{(a, b)\ |\ a \in A, b \in B \}]]></blockmath>
  <h2>例</h2>
  <p><math><![CDATA[A = \{1, 2, 3\}]]></math>、<math><![CDATA[B = \{4, 5, 6\}]]></math>の場合は</p>
  <blockmath><![CDATA[A \times B = \{(1, 4), (1, 5), (1, 6), (2, 4), (2, 5), (2, 6), (3, 4), (3, 5), (3, 6)\}]]></blockmath>
</body>

</ktml>